            <title>0.6.7</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 15:17:11 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.7</link>
            <sparkle:version>40</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.7

- Rebuilds the unified Workbench around one compact left navigation and removes duplicated sidebars and redundant top-level controls.
- Removes empty tab rails and oversized vertical gaps so every workflow starts at the top of its workspace.
- Restores compact, content-sized buttons throughout Home, Dictation, Support, Checkup, and Personalization.
- Preserves the approved dark Templeton Slate palette, Studio Hardware cards, model controls, Voice Studio artwork, and Kiki graphics.
- Gives Meetings, Voice Studio, Audio File, and Dictionary enough embedded space to keep their headings, instructions, and controls visible.
- Expands Personalization tables and form fields, keeps Guided Review aligned, and supports selecting and updating saved snippets.
- Adds keyboard focus treatment that matches Kiki's sage palette and verifies Command-A in editable text areas.
- Adds release diagnostics that reject duplicated legacy navigation and empty single-page tab strips.
]]></description>
